7
00:00:26,747 --> 00:00:32,182
Meet ValueRange. Company valuation, turned into an on-chain strategy with AI.

8
00:00:32,772 --> 00:00:37,087
Every business is different. Its valuation model should be, too.

9
00:00:37,356 --> 00:00:43,544
We turn financial reports and research into models built around how each company creates value.

10
00:00:43,804 --> 00:00:47,728
